<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>The Use of LLMs</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Large language models (LLMs), such as ChatGPT, were used exclusively for language polishing and minor stylistic editing of the manuscript. All technical ideas, analyses, and experimental results were conceived, implemented, and verified by the authors. The authors carefully reviewed and validated all text to ensure accuracy.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>WSVD algorithm</h3>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Weighted SVD Fine-tuning (WSVD) pseudo code</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
              
              
             Calibration dataset <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math>, model parameters <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{W\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{W\}</annotation></semantics></math>, rank <math id="alg1.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
              
              
             Fine-tuned low-rank factors <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{A,B\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{A,B\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each sample <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{i}\in X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{i}\in X</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
              Compute forward pass and loss <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}(x_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}(x_{i})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
              Backpropagate to obtain gradients <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\nabla_{W}\mathcal{L}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>W</mi></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\nabla_{W}\mathcal{L}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
              Accumulate importance weights <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F\leftarrow\sum_{X}(\nabla_{W}\mathcal{L})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>X</mi></msub><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>W</mi></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F\leftarrow\sum_{X}(\nabla_{W}\mathcal{L})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each weight matrix <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W\in\{W_{Q},W_{K},W_{V},\dots\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W\in\{W_{Q},W_{K},W_{V},\dots\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              Compute SVD: <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{h}\approx A_{h}B_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{h}\approx A_{h}B_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, with <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{h}\in\mathbb{R}^{m\times r},B_{h}\in\mathbb{R}^{r\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{h}\in\mathbb{R}^{m\times r},B_{h}\in\mathbb{R}^{r\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
              Define weighted loss:

<table id="A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{WSVD}}(A_{h},B_{h})=\bigl\|F_{h}^{1/2}\odot(W_{h}-A_{h}B_{h})\bigr\|_{F}^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>WSVD</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{WSVD}}(A_{h},B_{h})=\bigl\|F_{h}^{1/2}\odot(W_{h}-A_{h}B_{h})\bigr\|_{F}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>where <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{h},W_{h},A_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{h},W_{h},A_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> is each head’s importance weight, weight, decomposed matrices.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
              Locally fine-tune <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{h},B_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{h},B_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{WSVD}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>WSVD</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{WSVD}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  Fine-tuned low-rank factors <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{A_{h},B_{h}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{A_{h},B_{h}\}</annotation></semantics></math> for all matrices

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Detailed Results of WSVD-noQ</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We inlcude the detailed results of WSVD-noQ and other baselines in Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.3 Detailed Results of WSVD-noQ ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ WSVD: Weighted Low-Rank Approximation for Fast and Efficient Execution of Low-Precision Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
